Owner edit (hook.go is protected): let d1-nonet run cargo test binaries, so game-code tests run
inside containment. Apply from the repository root with:  git apply containment/proposals/2026-10-18-test-binaries.patch
then: cd containment/go && GOCACHE=$PWD/.gocache GOFLAGS=-mod=mod go test -count=1 ./... and reinstall the hook.

